{
  "item_id": "PRISMA_2020_11",
  "elements": [
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "For randomized controlled trials, the risk of bias was evaluated using the \"risk of bias\" tool presented in the Cochrane Handbook for Systematic Reviews of Interventions ( 19 ). ... To assess non-randomized intervention studies, we used \"a Cochrane risk of bias assessment tool: for non-randomized studies of interventions (ACROBAT-NRSI)\" ( 25 ).",
      "reason": "The authors specify the tools used for both randomized controlled trials (Cochrane Handbook tool) and non-randomized intervention studies (ACROBAT-NRSI)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "Specifically, we assessed the risk of bias in the following seven domains: sequence generation, allocation concealment, blinding of participants and outcome assessors, incomplete outcome data, selective outcome reporting, and other potential threats to validity. ... For nonrandomized intervention studies, we evaluated the risk of bias using the following seven domains: confounding, selection of participants, intervention measurements, departures from intended interventions, missing data, outcome measurement, and selective outcome reporting.",
      "reason": "The authors explicitly list the domains assessed for both the randomized and non-randomized risk-of-bias tools."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "In addition, for non-randomized intervention studies, we assessed the overall risk of bias following the results of the seven domains.",
      "reason": "The authors report that an overall risk-of-bias judgment was made for non-randomized studies based on the results of the seven domains."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No adaptations to the existing tools were reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No newly developed risk-of-bias tools were used."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e6",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "The first and second authors assessed the quality of the trials. ... We resolved all discrepancies by consensus.",
      "reason": "The authors state that the first and second authors assessed the quality (risk of bias) and resolved discrepancies by consensus. While 'independently' is not explicitly stated in this specific sentence, the context of 'first and second authors assessed' implies the standard dual-reviewer process, and the resolution of discrepancies confirms the process."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e7",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "There is no mention of contacting study investigators to obtain or confirm risk-of-bias information."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e8",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
